---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro'
import DayRating from '../../rateDay/rateDay.astro'

export const post = {
  day: 55,
  title: 'Day 55',
  date: '2026-10-31',
  description: 'visinting cementary day 1',
  category: 'Daily',
  tags: ['Astro', 'Tailwind CSS', 'Web Development'],
}
---

<Layout>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pb-24 pt-32">
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-16">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm">
        <span
          class="font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--secondary)]"
        >
          {post.category}
        </span>

        <span class="text-[var(--border)]">/</span>

        <span class="text-[var(--muted)]">
          Day {post.day}
        </span>
      </div>

      <h1
        class="mt-6 text-4xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl"
      >
        {post.title}
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-[var(--muted)]">
        {
          new Date(post.date).toLocaleDateString('en-GB', {
            day: 'numeric',
            month: 'long',
            year: 'numeric',
          })
        }
      </p>

      <p
        class="mt-8 border-l-2 border-[var(--secondary)] pl-5 text-lg leading-8 text-[var(--muted)] sm:text-xl"
      >
        {post.description}
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Content -->
    <divh class="space-y-14 leading-8">
      <!-- Section -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
          What I did today?
        </h2>
        <p>
          Today,I wake up early and I made breakfast for me and my family , I
          also spend some time with them when we wathched a "you" , We started
          together, and we are still at the same ep, It's great, after we
          watched some episodes, we visited cementary and grandma, and I also
          meet my aunnt and cousin, so it was quite fun we were there for a
          moment, and we returned, in Car my brother recommended me a book about
          hell and books, I don't remember title, but It the most important
          things, I even can say I'll end this book tommorrow(becouse It already
          happend) We also were in shop to buy usefull things for live in Lodz
          after that we returned , and we were watching this series still( he
          finally got a girlfriend like him )

          <html lang="en">
            <head>
              <meta charset="utf-8" />
              <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
              <meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
              <title>Document</title>
            </head>
            <body> </body>
          </html>
        </p>
      </section>
    </divh>

    <!-- Section -->
    <section class="py-5">
      <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
        Plans for tomorrow
      </h2>

      <p>I didnt have any plans for next few days, i'm writing it 4.11</p>

      <!-- Section -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
          How I rate this day
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <p>
            I'll give 3/10, becouse I readed book form my brother, and I count
            reading like something good
          </p>
          <DayRating class="w-full" rating={3} />
        </div>
      </section>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>
